  "description": "<p><b>Brand Introduction:</b></p>\r\n<p>Paw Pattern is a pet-focused brand that creates personalized apparel featuring custom embroidered portraits of beloved dogs. We celebrate the special bond between pets and their owners by offering unique, high-quality products that allow people to keep their furry friends close.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p><b>Product Description:</b></p>\r\n<p>Our products include custom t-shirts, sweatshirts, and caps each featuring a hand-drawn illustration of your dog, transformed into a beautiful embroidered design. With endless customization options, every item is one-of-a-kind and made to reflect the personality of each pet.</p>\r\n<p><b>USP (Unique Selling Point):</b></p>\r\n<p>We turn a simple photo of your dog into a high-quality embroidered portrait on clothing, combining art, personalization, and love for pets in a way that resonates deeply with pet owners.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p><b>Payment Terms:</b></p>\r\n<p>Earn a competitive commission on every sale generated through your affiliate links. Payments are made monthly via PayPal.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p><b>Other Information:</b></p>\r\n<p>As a Paw Pattern affiliate, you&rsquo;ll have access to exclusive discounts, early product releases, and marketing materials to help you promote effectively. Join us and share the love for pets while earning great rewards!</p>",
